---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Meditize"
  description="Why we built Meditize: turning mandatory work breaks into a restorative sanctuary for your eyes."
>
  <section class="page-hero wrap" slot="hero">
    <h1>Why we built Meditize</h1>
    <p>Simplicity, privacy and science — the three things every break should respect.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section narrow prose">
    <p class="lead">
      In a world that lives behind screens, eye health has become an afterthought. We observed that
      most productivity tools focus on getting more done, but none focus on how you feel while doing
      it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Meditize was born from a simple need: to transform mandatory work breaks into a restorative
      sanctuary. We didn’t want another annoying pop-up. We wanted a companion that guides you
      through eye care using the power of sound and movement.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Core Principles</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Simplicity:</strong> One click to install, one click to relax.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Privacy First:</strong> We don’t track your browsing history. Your health is your business.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Science-Backed:</strong> Every exercise is designed to combat digital eye strain and refresh
        your vision.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
